"title": "BP (LSE:BP.) Enters Talks On Brazil Oil Block Stake Move",
"description": null,
"summary": "BP (LSE:BP.) is in talks to sell a stake in the offshore Bumerangue oil block in Brazil to Petrobras. The discussions focus on Petrobras taking a partner role in the Bumerangue field, which lies in Brazilian deepwater acreage. The negotiations could reshape BP's portfolio exposure in Brazil if a Bumerangue stake sale to Petrobras goes ahead. The potential Bumerangue stake sale to Petrobras matters, but it should not dominate every decision you make on BP. We have also spotted 3 warning signs...",
